# Repository-wide ignores only.
#
# Rule of thumb: a pattern belongs here only if it applies to the whole tree or to
# root-level files. Anything produced by a package's own toolchain belongs in that
# package's .gitignore:
#   pomodoro-frontend/.gitignore  — Node/Vite build and tooling output
#   pomodoro-backend/.gitignore   — backend build and tooling output

# Secrets — deliberately repo-wide so a stray env file anywhere is never committable.
# This is the one intentional overlap with package-level files; do not re-declare it there.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Claude Code machine-local configuration (governance in .claude/ is tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Root-level working notes
test_plan.md

# OS and editor artifacts (can appear in any directory)
.DS_Store
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
